        {
            "heading": "Technical Workshops & Warehousing at the OSC",
            "paragraphs": [
                "The Operations Support Centre houses multiskilled workshops for firefighting PPE and equipment to support fire stations across Greater London. Skilled and qualified technicians undertake safety critical work to ensure that firefighters get the best possible equipment to use. Additionally, the OSC provides a warehousing solution and delivery service to the LFB."
